{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Seventyfold.</b> Seven generations, for this word is neither fourteen nor three hundred forty-three. The proof: \"and the light of the sun shall be sevenfold\" (Isaiah 30:26), and afterward the prophet explained his words and said, \"like the light of seven days.\"" "The meaning of יֻקָם is that his vengeance shall be taken. Likewise, \"he shall not be punished\" (Exodus 21:21). The reason is that HaShem was slow to anger against Cain until seven generations. Do not wonder how he lived all those years, for his brother Seth lived with Noah many years. It is also possible that the seed of Cain is called by the name of their father, like \"Israel.\" Some say the sign was a horn, and others said He gave strength to his heart and removed fear from him. What seems correct to me is that HaShem made him a sign so that he would believe, and Scripture did not disclose the sign."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:13.331664549Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}